    @subsection xmlsec_v_1_0_1 xmlsec Module Version 1.0.1

    <b>Bug Fixes:</b>
    - Fixed memory leak in \c QoreXmlDoc::getString() where XML memory allocated by libxml2
      was not being freed after copying to the Qore string
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/5107">issue 5107</a>)
    - Fixed \c XmlSecKey::getName() returning incorrect value due to xmlChar pointer cast issue
    - Fixed typo in error message: "could node find node" corrected to "could not find node"
    - Fixed syntax error (extra closing parenthesis) in \c XmlSecKey::setCertificate()
    - Fixed potential null pointer dereference in \c DSigCtx::getTransformStatus()

    <b>Thread Safety Improvements:</b>
    - Added proper locking to \c XmlSecKey::clone() and \c XmlSecKey::copy() methods
    - Added proper locking to \c XmlSecKeyManager::getKeyManager() method
    - Added big_lock synchronization to \c DSigCtx::verify() for consistency with sign operations

    <b>Build System Updates:</b>
    - Updated GitLab CI to use modern k8s tag
    - Fixed GitHub API calls to use correct organization and token-based authentication
    - Updated spec file for CMake-based builds
